# Gift of Perfection: Bot2 reveals two Islands before its Ornithopter (CR 701.20a); the creature is assimilated and the
# two Islands go to the bottom of Bot2's own library (CR 401.4), under the Forests that were beneath them, so Bot2's next
# draw is a Forest and no Island (its opening hand held none).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Gift of Perfection
Island x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet x7
Island x9
Ornithopter
Forest x8

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Gift of Perfection.Cast(Spend: U, U, U, U, B)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Choose(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Subtypes = Borg
? Bot2.Library.Count = 17
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot2.Hand.Island = (absent)
? Bot2.Hand.Forest.Colors.Count = 0

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
